<title>HONG KONG: HK's SmarTone shares debut at HK$17.25.</title>
<headline>HK's SmarTone shares debut at HK$17.25.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1996-10-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shares of mobile telephone operator SmarTone Telecommunications Holdings Ltd made their trading debut at HK$17.25 in Hong Kong on Thursday, unchanged from their issue price.  </p>
<p>SmarTone offered 84 million shares globally of which 15 percent was offered in Hong Kong and 85 percent in an international placement.</p>
<p>Its Hong Kong flotation was 2.95 times subscribed.</p>
<p>Major shareholders of SmarTone include Sun Hung Kai Properties Ltd, AT&amp;T Wireless Communications, ABC Communications (Holdings) Ltd, and Town Khan Ltd, a unit of China's Ministry of Post and Telecommunications.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6370</p>
</text>
